  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;(Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;(put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So, the required diagram is&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0104_9712951e2213.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
